  "description": {
   "content": [
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "In the implementation of Memento versioning in the community Fedora impl. We have some questions about what headers remain the same when requesting a Memento of a resource versus requesting the actual resource.",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "This ticket is to document what headers are returned by each and give room for discussion of reasons for these decisions.",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    }
   ],
